#: data/maps/Route114_FossilManiacsTunnel/scripts.inc:56
msgctxt "Route114_FossilManiacsTunnel_Text_LookInDesertForFossils"
msgid ""
"I'm the FOSSIL MANIAC…\n"
"I'm a nice guy who loves FOSSILS…\p"
"Do you want a FOSSIL?\p"
"But the FOSSILS around these parts all\n"
"belong to me… None for you…\p"
"If you can't bear to go without\n"
"a FOSSIL, look in a desert where there\l"
"are boulders and sand that may hide\l"
"FOSSILS…$"
msgstr ""
"我是化石迷……是个喜欢化石的好人……\p"
"你想要化石吗？\p"
"可是这一带的化石全都是我的……\n"
"不能给你……\p"
"如果你实在想要化石，\n"
"就去沙漠里找找吧，那里的岩石和\l"
"沙子下面可能藏着化石……$"

#: data/maps/Route114_FossilManiacsTunnel/scripts.inc:67
msgctxt "Route114_FossilManiacsTunnel_Text_DevonCorpRevivingFossils"
msgid ""
"You found a FOSSIL, didn't you?\n"
"That's so nice… It's so dreamy…\p"
"What are you going to do with that\n"
"FOSSIL?\p"
"From what I've heard, DEVON is doing\n"
"research on reviving POKéMON from\l"
"FOSSILS…\p"
"I love my FOSSILS, so I would never\n"
"do anything like that…$"
msgstr ""
"你找到化石了吧？\n"
"真好……真让人陶醉……\p"
"你打算拿那块化石做什么呢？\p"
"我听说，得文公司正在\n"
"研究让宝可梦从化石中复活……\p"
"我很爱我的化石，\n"
"所以我绝对不会做那种事……$"

#: data/maps/Route114_FossilManiacsTunnel/scripts.inc:78
msgctxt "Route114_FossilManiacsTunnel_Text_FossilsAreWonderful"
msgid ""
"FOSSILS are so… Wonderful…\n"
"It's so dreamy…$"
msgstr ""
"化石真是……太美妙了……\n"
"真让人陶醉……$"

#: data/maps/Route114_FossilManiacsTunnel/scripts.inc:82
msgctxt "Route114_FossilManiacsTunnel_Text_NotSafeThatWay"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"It's not safe that way…\p"
"I was digging away, you see…\n"
"When the whole wall collapsed…\p"
"I think there's a giant cavern\n"
"underneath now…\p"
"But I've left it alone because I don't\n"
"think there are any FOSSILS there…$"
msgstr ""
"哦……那边很危险……\p"
"我正在挖着挖着……\n"
"整面墙突然就塌了……\p"
"我想现在下面应该有一个巨大的洞窟……\p"
"不过我觉得那里没有化石，\n"
"所以就没去管它……$"
